sequenceDiagram
    participant PM as Project Manager
    participant UI as E4H Web UI (Extended)
    participant GW as E4H API Gateway (Existing)
    participant AUTH as E4H Auth Service (Existing)
    participant FPS as Field Planner Service (NEW)
    participant AMS as Activity Management Service (NEW)
    participant PS as Project Service (Existing)
    participant HFR as Health Facility Registry (Existing)
    participant HRMS as eGov HRMS (Existing)
    participant EGOV_FS as eGov Filestore (Existing)
    participant MDMS as eGov MDMS v2 (Existing)
    participant WF as eGov Workflow v2 (Existing)
    participant DB as E4H PostgreSQL (Shared)
    participant QUEUE as Kafka Queue (Shared)
    
    Note over PM,QUEUE: E4H Integrated Field Plan Creation and Activity Assignment
    
    PM->>UI: Navigate to Create Field Plan (E4H UI)
    UI->>GW: GET /user/oauth/me
    GW->>AUTH: Validate PM JWT token
    AUTH-->>GW: PM authenticated with project creation permissions
    GW-->>UI: User authenticated
    
    UI->>GW: GET /project/v1/_search?assignedToMe=true
    GW->>PS: Fetch projects for user (existing service)
    PS->>HRMS: GET /egov-hrms/employees/_search
    Note over PS,HRMS: Validate PM employee and get assignments
    HRMS-->>PS: PM employee validated with project assignments
    
    PS->>DB: Query existing project table where user is PM or assigned
    DB-->>PS: Return project list
    PS-->>GW: Return projects
    GW-->>UI: Return project options
    UI-->>PM: Display project selection dropdown
    
    PM->>UI: Select project and fill field plan details
    Note over PM,UI: Project, Dates, Geography, Activities
    
    PM->>UI: Click "Generate Facility Template"
    UI->>GW: POST /field-planner/v1/field-plans/facility-template
    GW->>FPS: Generate facility template request (new service)
    
    FPS->>PS: GET /project/v1/{projectId}
    Note over FPS,PS: Get project facility associations
    PS-->>FPS: Project with facility associations
    
    FPS->>HFR: GET /facility/v1/_search
    Note over FPS,HFR: Get facility details by geography filter
    HFR->>DB: Query existing facility table with geography filter
    DB-->>HFR: Return filtered facilities
    HFR-->>FPS: Facility details with location, type, status
    
    FPS->>MDMS: POST /egov-mdms-service/v1/_search
    Note over FPS,MDMS: Get boundary data for template dropdowns
    MDMS-->>FPS: Boundary hierarchy data
    
    FPS->>EGOV_FS: POST /filestore/v1/files (generate template)
    Note over FPS,EGOV_FS: All facilities pre-selected with Yes/No column
    EGOV_FS->>EGOV_FS: Create Excel with validation dropdowns
    EGOV_FS-->>FPS: Return template UUID and URL
    FPS-->>GW: Return template download link
    GW-->>UI: Return template URL
    UI-->>PM: Download facility template from eGov Filestore
    
    PM->>PM: Review and modify facility selections
    PM->>UI: Upload modified facility list
    
    UI->>GW: POST /field-planner/v1/field-plans/_create (with facility file)
    GW->>FPS: Create field plan request (new service)
    
    FPS->>HRMS: GET /egov-hrms/employees/_search
    Note over FPS,HRMS: Validate PM employee creating field plan
    HRMS-->>FPS: PM validated
    
    FPS->>EGOV_FS: POST /filestore/v1/files (process uploaded file)
    EGOV_FS->>EGOV_FS: Validate file format and structure
    
    alt Invalid File Format
        EGOV_FS-->>FPS: Return format error
        FPS-->>GW: Return validation error
        GW-->>UI: Show error message
        UI-->>PM: Display "Invalid file format" error
    else Valid File Format
        EGOV_FS->>EGOV_FS: Parse facility selections
        EGOV_FS-->>FPS: Return facility selection data
        
        FPS->>HFR: GET /facility/v1/_search
        Note over FPS,HFR: Validate selected facilities exist and are active
        HFR-->>FPS: Validated facility data
        
        FPS->>DB: Begin transaction
        FPS->>DB: Create field_plans record (new table)
        DB-->>FPS: Return field plan UUID
        
        loop For each selected facility
            FPS->>DB: Create field_plan_facilities record (new table)
            DB-->>FPS: Confirm facility association
        end
        
        FPS->>DB: Commit transaction
        DB-->>FPS: Transaction committed
        
        FPS-->>GW: Field plan created successfully
        GW-->>UI: Return success response
        UI-->>PM: Show "Field plan created, now assign activities"
    end
    
    Note over PM,QUEUE: Activity Assignment Phase (E4H Integration)
    
    PM->>UI: Assign activities to Activity SPOCs
    UI->>GW: GET /field-planner/v1/activities/_search?active=true
    GW->>AMS: Fetch available activities (new service)
    AMS->>MDMS: POST /egov-mdms-service/v1/_search
    Note over AMS,MDMS: Get activity master data with required roles
    MDMS-->>AMS: Return activity list with required roles
    AMS-->>GW: Return activities
    GW-->>UI: Display activity assignment form
    
    loop For each selected activity
        PM->>UI: Select activity and assign SPOCs
        
        PM->>UI: Search for Installation SPOC
        UI->>GW: GET /egov-hrms/employees/_search?role=INSTALLATION_SPOC
        GW->>HRMS: Search employees with role (existing service)
        HRMS->>DB: Query eg_hrms_employee table with specified designation
        DB-->>HRMS: Return matching employees
        HRMS-->>GW: Return employee list
        GW-->>UI: Display employee dropdown
        
        PM->>UI: Select Installation SPOC
        PM->>UI: Search for QC SPOC (Installation Reviewer)
        UI->>GW: GET /egov-hrms/employees/_search?role=QC_SPOC
        GW->>HRMS: Search QC employees (existing service)
        HRMS->>DB: Query eg_hrms_employee table for QC roles
        DB-->>HRMS: Return QC employees
        HRMS-->>GW: Return QC employee list
        GW-->>UI: Display QC employee dropdown
        
        PM->>UI: Select QC SPOC and set dates
        PM->>UI: Confirm activity assignment
    end
    
    PM->>UI: Submit all activity assignments
    UI->>GW: POST /field-planner/v1/field-plans/{id}/assign-activities
    GW->>AMS: Process activity assignments (new service)
    
    AMS->>HRMS: GET /egov-hrms/employees/_search
    Note over AMS,HRMS: Validate all assigned SPOCs exist and are active
    HRMS-->>AMS: All SPOCs validated
    
    AMS->>DB: Begin transaction
    
    loop For each activity assignment
        AMS->>DB: Create activity_assignments record (new table)
        DB-->>AMS: Return assignment UUID
        
        loop For each facility in field plan
            AMS->>DB: Create facility_activities record (new table, SCHEDULED status)
            DB-->>AMS: Return facility activity UUID
            
            AMS->>AMS: Evaluate activation conditions
            Note over AMS: Check if conditions are met for immediate activation
            
            alt Conditions Met
                AMS->>DB: Update status to ACTIVE
                AMS->>DB: Set activated_at timestamp
                DB-->>AMS: Status updated
            else Conditions Not Met
                Note over AMS: Facility remains SCHEDULED
            end
        end
    end
    
    AMS->>WF: POST /egov-wf-v2/process/_initiate
    Note over AMS,WF: Initialize activity assignment workflows
    WF-->>AMS: Workflows initiated
    
    AMS->>DB: Commit transaction
    DB-->>AMS: All assignments created
    
    Note over AMS,QUEUE: Send Notifications via E4H Kafka Events
    
    loop For each assigned SPOC
        AMS->>QUEUE: Publish ActivityAssignmentEvent
        Note over QUEUE: E4H notification consumers will handle email/in-app notifications
        
        AMS->>HRMS: GET /egov-hrms/employees/_search
        Note over AMS,HRMS: Get SPOC employee details for notification
        HRMS->>DB: Query eg_hrms_employee table
        DB-->>HRMS: Return employee details
        HRMS-->>AMS: Return employee data
        
        Note over AMS: E4H notification system handles:
        Note over AMS: - Email notifications
        Note over AMS: - In-app notifications
        Note over AMS: - WebSocket real-time updates
    end
    
    Note over AMS: E4H audit patterns handle assignment logging automatically
    
    AMS-->>GW: All assignments completed successfully
    GW-->>UI: Return success response
    UI-->>PM: Show "Activities assigned successfully"
    
    UI->>UI: Display assignment summary
    Note over UI: Show assigned SPOCs, facility counts, active vs scheduled
    
    Note over PM,QUEUE: Activity SPOCs receive E4H notifications and can begin work
    
    participant SPOC as Activity SPOC
    
    SPOC->>UI: Login to E4H system
    UI->>GW: POST /user/oauth/authenticate
    GW->>AUTH: Authenticate SPOC employee
    AUTH->>HRMS: GET /egov-hrms/employees/_search
    Note over AUTH,HRMS: Validate SPOC employee credentials
    HRMS-->>AUTH: Employee validated
    AUTH-->>GW: Return E4H JWT token
    GW-->>UI: Authentication successful
    
    UI->>GW: GET /field-planner/v1/notifications?unread=true
    Note over UI,GW: E4H notification system integration
    GW-->>UI: Display notifications from E4H notification service
    UI-->>SPOC: Show "New field plan assignment" notification
    
    SPOC->>UI: Click on assignment notification
    UI->>GW: GET /field-planner/v1/activity-assignments/_search?assignedToMe=true
    GW->>AMS: Get assignments for SPOC employee
    AMS->>DB: Query activity_assignments table for SPOC
    DB-->>AMS: Return assignment details with field plan context
    
    AMS->>HFR: GET /facility/v1/_search
    Note over AMS,HFR: Get facility details for assignment dashboard
    HFR-->>AMS: Facility details for each assignment
    
    AMS-->>GW: Return assignments with facility counts
    GW-->>UI: Display assignment dashboard
    UI-->>SPOC: Show assigned field plans and facility counts
    
    Note over PM,SPOC: E4H Platform Integration Complete
    Note over PM,SPOC: Field plan created via new Field Planner Service
    Note over PM,SPOC: SPOCs validated and notified via eGov HRMS and E4H notifications
    Note over PM,SPOC: All data stored in shared E4H PostgreSQL database 